---
// Three-Way Reconciliation Triangle Matrix (Ledger, Gateway, Bank) Diagram Component
---

<figure class="twr-diag" aria-labelledby="twr-diag-caption">
  <!-- Desktop SVG Layout -->
  <svg
    class="twr-diag__desktop"
    viewBox="0 0 880 290"
    role="img"
    aria-labelledby="twr-diag-title twr-diag-desc"
  >
    <title id="twr-diag-title">三方對帳三角矩陣拓撲圖</title>
    <desc id="twr-diag-desc">
      展示內部核心帳本、支付網關流水與銀行官方清算文件三者之間的雙向比對校驗閉環。
    </desc>

    <defs>
      <marker
        id="twr-arrow-blue"
        viewBox="0 0 10 10"
        refX="8"
        refY="5"
        markerWidth="7"
        markerHeight="7"
        orient="auto"
      >
        <path d="M 0 0 L 10 5 L 0 10 z" class="twr-diag__arrow-head--blue"
        ></path>
      </marker>
      <marker
        id="twr-arrow-purple"
        viewBox="0 0 10 10"
        refX="8"
        refY="5"
        markerWidth="7"
        markerHeight="7"
        orient="auto"
      >
        <path d="M 0 0 L 10 5 L 0 10 z" class="twr-diag__arrow-head--purple"
        ></path>
      </marker>
    </defs>

    <!-- Outer Card Background -->
    <rect
      x="25"
      y="15"
      width="830"
      height="260"
      rx="12"
      class="twr-diag__card-bg"></rect>

    <!-- Top Node: Internal Ledger (x: 290, width: 300) -->
    <g transform="translate(290, 30)">
      <rect
        width="300"
        height="60"
        rx="8"
        class="twr-diag__box twr-diag__box--green"></rect>
      <text
        x="150"
        y="26"
        class="twr-diag__title twr-diag__title--green"
        text-anchor="middle"
      >
        1. 內部核心帳本 (Internal Ledger)
      </text>
      <text x="150" y="46" class="twr-diag__desc" text-anchor="middle">
        業務系統訂單與雙式記帳會計流水
      </text>
    </g>

    <!-- Arrows from Top to Bottom Nodes -->
    <path
      d="M 370 90 L 220 150"
      class="twr-diag__path twr-diag__path--blue"
      marker-end="url(#twr-arrow-blue)"></path>
    <text x="255" y="115" class="twr-diag__path-tag">校驗交易存在性</text>

    <path
      d="M 510 90 L 660 150"
      class="twr-diag__path twr-diag__path--blue"
      marker-end="url(#twr-arrow-blue)"></path>
    <text x="615" y="115" class="twr-diag__path-tag">校驗資金入帳頭寸</text>

    <!-- Bottom Left Node: Payment Gateway (x: 50, width: 330) -->
    <g transform="translate(50, 155)">
      <rect
        width="330"
        height="70"
        rx="8"
        class="twr-diag__box twr-diag__box--blue"></rect>
      <text
        x="165"
        y="28"
        class="twr-diag__title twr-diag__title--blue"
        text-anchor="middle"
      >
        2. 支付網關交易紀錄 (Gateway Logs)
      </text>
      <text x="165" y="50" class="twr-diag__desc" text-anchor="middle">
        Stripe / Adyen 通訊狀態與授權憑據
      </text>
    </g>

    <!-- Bottom Right Node: Bank Settlement (x: 500, width: 330) -->
    <g transform="translate(500, 155)">
      <rect
        width="330"
        height="70"
        rx="8"
        class="twr-diag__box twr-diag__box--purple"></rect>
      <text
        x="165"
        y="28"
        class="twr-diag__title twr-diag__title--purple"
        text-anchor="middle"
      >
        3. 銀行清算報表 (Bank Settlement File)
      </text>
      <text x="165" y="50" class="twr-diag__desc" text-anchor="middle">
        官方 MT940 / Camt.053 對帳單與手續費明細
      </text>
    </g>

    <!-- Horizontal Bidirectional Arrow for Gateway <-> Bank Closed Loop -->
    <path
      d="M 385 185 L 492 185"
      class="twr-diag__path twr-diag__path--purple twr-diag__path--dashed"
      marker-end="url(#twr-arrow-purple)"></path>
    <path
      d="M 495 195 L 388 195"
      class="twr-diag__path twr-diag__path--purple twr-diag__path--dashed"
      marker-end="url(#twr-arrow-purple)"></path>
    <rect
      x="400"
      y="172"
      width="80"
      height="20"
      rx="4"
      class="twr-diag__loop-pill"></rect>
    <text x="440" y="186" class="twr-diag__loop-text" text-anchor="middle"
      >閉環校驗</text
    >
  </svg>

  <!-- Mobile View (Vertical Cards) -->
  <div class="twr-diag__mobile">
    <div class="twr-mobile-card twr-mobile-card--green">
      <span class="twr-mobile-badge twr-mobile-badge--green"
        >NODE 1: 內部帳本</span
      >
      <h4>1. 內部核心帳本 (Internal Ledger)</h4>
      <p>
        訂單系統與借貸複式記帳。記錄使用者交易事實、應收金額與商戶結算標籤。
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="twr-mobile-card twr-mobile-card--blue">
      <span class="twr-mobile-badge twr-mobile-badge--blue"
        >NODE 2: 渠道流水</span
      >
      <h4>2. 支付網關交易紀錄 (Payment Gateway)</h4>
      <p>
        Stripe、Adyen 等收單機構 API 通訊紀錄。記錄網關傳回的 Authorization Code
        與 Charge ID。
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="twr-mobile-card twr-mobile-card--purple">
      <span class="twr-mobile-badge twr-mobile-badge--purple"
        >NODE 3: 銀行清單</span
      >
      <h4>3. 銀行結算清單 (Bank Settlement File)</h4>
      <p>
        官方銀行產出之 MT940 或 Camt.053
        對帳檔。記錄真正進入銀行帳戶的結算淨額與手續費。
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="twr-mobile-card twr-mobile-card--closed">
      <span class="twr-mobile-badge twr-mobile-badge--closed">CLOSED LOOP</span>
      <h4>三方閉環交叉比對規則</h4>
      <p>• <strong>帳本 vs 網關：</strong>防止漏單或偽造請求。</p>
      <p>• <strong>網關 vs 銀行：</strong>核實渠道代扣款項是否足額抵達銀行。</p>
      <p>
        • <strong>帳本 vs 銀行：</strong>最終確保內部餘額與外部銀行頭寸 100%
        平帳。
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <figcaption id="twr-diag-caption" class="twr-diag__caption">
    圖二：三方對帳三角矩陣（內部帳本、支付網關與銀行清算檔）閉環校驗架構
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .twr-diag {
    margin: 2.5rem 0;
    width: 100%;
  }

  .twr-diag__desktop {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
  }

  .twr-diag__mobile {
    display: none;
  }

  .twr-diag__caption {
    margin-top: 0.875rem;
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    color: var(--dg-muted, #8b949e);
    text-align: center;
    line-height: 1.4;
  }

  /* SVG Theme Token Styles */
  .twr-diag__card-bg {
    fill: var(--dg-surface, #161b22);
    stroke: var(--dg-rule, #30363d);
    stroke-width: 1.5px;
  }

  .twr-diag__box {
    stroke-width: 1.5px;
  }

  .twr-diag__box--green {
    fill: var(--dg-surface-2, #1b2e23);
    stroke: #238636;
  }

  .twr-diag__box--blue {
    fill: var(--dg-surface-2, #1f242c);
    stroke: #388bfd;
  }

  .twr-diag__box--purple {
    fill: var(--dg-surface-2, #241b35);
    stroke: #bc8cff;
  }

  .twr-diag__title {
    font-family:
      system-ui,
      -apple-system,
      sans-serif;
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .twr-diag__title--green {
    fill: #3fb950;
  }

  .twr-diag__title--blue {
    fill: #58a6ff;
  }

  .twr-diag__title--purple {
    fill: #d2a8ff;
  }

  .twr-diag__desc {
    font-family:
      system-ui,
      -apple-system,
      sans-serif;
    font-size: 11px;
    fill: var(--dg-ink-2, #8b949e);
  }

  .twr-diag__path {
    fill: none;
    stroke-width: 2px;
  }

  .twr-diag__path--blue {
    stroke: #388bfd;
  }

  .twr-diag__path--purple {
    stroke: #bc8cff;
  }

  .twr-diag__path--dashed {
    stroke-dasharray: 4 3;
  }

  .twr-diag__arrow-head--blue {
    fill: #388bfd;
  }

  .twr-diag__arrow-head--purple {
    fill: #bc8cff;
  }

  .twr-diag__path-tag {
    font-family:
      system-ui,
      -apple-system,
      sans-serif;
    font-size: 10px;
    font-weight: 600;
    fill: var(--dg-ink-2, #8b949e);
  }

  .twr-diag__loop-pill {
    fill: var(--dg-surface, #161b22);
    stroke: var(--dg-rule, #30363d);
    stroke-width: 1px;
  }

  .twr-diag__loop-text {
    font-family:
      system-ui,
      -apple-system,
      sans-serif;
    font-size: 9px;
    font-weight: 700;
    fill: #d2a8ff;
  }

  /* Light Theme Adjustments */
  :global(:root:not([data-theme="dark"])) .twr-diag__card-bg {
    fill: var(--dg-surface, #ffffff);
    stroke: var(--dg-rule, #d0d7de);
  }

  :global(:root:not([data-theme="dark"])) .twr-diag__box--green {
    fill: #dafbe1;
    stroke: #1a7f37;
  }

  :global(:root:not([data-theme="dark"])) .twr-diag__box--blue {
    fill: #eff7ff;
    stroke: #0969da;
  }

  :global(:root:not([data-theme="dark"])) .twr-diag__box--purple {
    fill: #fbefff;
    stroke: #8250df;
  }

  :global(:root:not([data-theme="dark"])) .twr-diag__title--green {
    fill: #1a7f37;
  }

  :global(:root:not([data-theme="dark"])) .twr-diag__title--blue {
    fill: #0969da;
  }

  :global(:root:not([data-theme="dark"])) .twr-diag__title--purple {
    fill: #8250df;
  }

  :global(:root:not([data-theme="dark"])) .twr-diag__path--blue {
    stroke: #0969da;
  }

  :global(:root:not([data-theme="dark"])) .twr-diag__path--purple {
    stroke: #8250df;
  }

  :global(:root:not([data-theme="dark"])) .twr-diag__arrow-head--blue {
    fill: #0969da;
  }

  :global(:root:not([data-theme="dark"])) .twr-diag__arrow-head--purple {
    fill: #8250df;
  }

  :global(:root:not([data-theme="dark"])) .twr-diag__loop-pill {
    fill: #ffffff;
    stroke: var(--dg-rule, #d0d7de);
  }

  :global(:root:not([data-theme="dark"])) .twr-diag__loop-text {
    fill: #8250df;
  }

  /* Mobile Responsive View */
  @media (max-width: 48rem) {
    .twr-diag__desktop {
      display: none !important;
    }

    .twr-diag__mobile {
      display: flex !important;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 0.875rem;
    }

    .twr-mobile-card {
      padding: 1rem 1.125rem;
      border-radius: 0.5rem;
      border: 1px solid var(--dg-rule, #30363d);
      background: var(--dg-surface, #161b22);
    }

    .twr-mobile-card--green {
      border-color: #238636;
      background: rgba(35, 134, 54, 0.05);
    }

    .twr-mobile-card--blue {
      border-color: #388bfd;
      background: rgba(56, 139, 253, 0.05);
    }

    .twr-mobile-card--purple {
      border-color: #bc8cff;
      background: rgba(188, 140, 255, 0.05);
    }

    .twr-mobile-card--closed {
      border-color: #d29922;
      background: rgba(210, 153, 34, 0.05);
    }

    .twr-mobile-badge {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 0.125rem 0.4rem;
      border-radius: 0.25rem;
      font-size: 0.6875rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 0.05em;
      margin-bottom: 0.375rem;
    }

    .twr-mobile-badge--green {
      background: rgba(35, 134, 54, 0.2);
      color: #3fb950;
    }

    .twr-mobile-badge--blue {
      background: rgba(56, 139, 253, 0.2);
      color: #58a6ff;
    }

    .twr-mobile-badge--purple {
      background: rgba(188, 140, 255, 0.2);
      color: #d2a8ff;
    }

    .twr-mobile-badge--closed {
      background: rgba(210, 153, 34, 0.2);
      color: #e3b341;
    }

    .twr-mobile-card h4 {
      margin: 0 0 0.375rem;
      font-size: 0.9375rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--dg-ink, #f0f6fc);
    }

    .twr-mobile-card p {
      margin: 0 0 0.25rem;
      font-size: 0.8125rem;
      line-height: 1.5;
      color: var(--dg-ink-2, #8b949e);
    }

    .twr-mobile-card p:last-child {
      margin-bottom: 0;
    }
  }
</style>
